OL,3,GNEWSAHospital charity plea to fund
OL,4,A'vital' play therapy
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor children who are facing long
OL,7,Fhospital stays for treatment like
OL,8,Fchemotherapy or transplantation, being
OL,9,Fable to spend some time at play is an
OL,10,Fessential part of helping them through
OL,11,Fa tough time.
OL,13,FArts and crafts, music therapy and
OL,14,Fvideo games are just some of the things
OL,15,Fyoung patients are offered to help them
OL,16,Fthrough treatment at Leeds Children's
OL,17,FHospital.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
