OL,3,GNEWSAHospital charity plea to fund
OL,4,A'vital' play therapy
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlay manager Lisa Beaumont said the
OL,7,Fsessions are vital to support children
OL,8,Fon their hospital journeys, helping
OL,9,Fthem to understand their treatment and
OL,10,Freduce trauma.
OL,12,FThe Leeds Hospitals Charity provides
OL,13,Fmore than 300 therapeutic play sessions
OL,14,Feach week, and is now asking people to
OL,15,Fbecome regular donors so the service
OL,16,Fcan continue.
